# {{ app_naam }}

Dit project is gegenereerd met **AppCreator CLI** en bevat regels en skills voor {{ assistant_namen }}.

## 🚀 Snelle Start

{% if backend or frontend -%}
Start alle onderdelen met gecombineerde logs:
```bash
appcreator dev   # of ./dev.sh
```

{% endif -%}
{% if backend == "fastapi" -%}
### Backend (FastAPI)
```bash
cd backend
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # Op Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
```
API documentatie is direct beschikbaar op: `http://localhost:8000/docs` en health status op `http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health`.

{% endif -%}
{% if frontend == "vue3" -%}
### Frontend (Vue 3 + Vite + Tailwind + Shadcn)
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```
Applicatie opent op: `http://localhost:5173`

{% endif -%}
{% if hardware == "esp32" -%}
### Embedded Firmware (ESP32)
```bash
pio run --target upload
pio device monitor -b 115200
```

{% endif -%}
{% if cli == "python-typer" -%}
### CLI (Typer + Rich)
```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # Op Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -e ".[dev]"
{{ app_slug }} --help
pytest
```

{% endif -%}
{% if database == "postgres" -%}
### Docker Compose
Start de database met:
```bash
docker compose up -d postgres
```
De host-poort staat in `POSTGRES_PORT` in `.env`.

{% endif -%}
